  "question": {
    "text": "Young's double slit experiment is carried out by using green, red and blue light, one color at a time. The fringe widths recorded are $\\beta_{G}, \\beta_{R}$ and $\\beta_{B}$, respectively. Then,",
    "image": null
  },
